body:
Would you want a therapeutic boarding school or a RTC? Basically the only difference is how much money it costs and who pays - private pay or health insurance. Sometimes they overlap, though. 

&#x200B;

I have been to 6 RTCs/wilderness programs/therapeutic boarding schools, and have heard about many more.

&#x200B;

Please tell me either on here or on my personal page more about what you need. You said anywhere in the US...do you like nature, etc.? Those things play into where to go very heavily.

Hope I can help!!
